venance at write time prevents hallucinated citations at read time.","Deterministic retrieval: Graph traversal is fully reproducible, separating factual evidence traces from stochastic LLM generation.","Explicit abstention: The agent identifies missing graph edges and returns \"insufficient evidence\" rather than guessing.","A complete walkthrough of designing, wiring, and shipping governed AI agents entirely on your own infrastructure.","[]( []( ▶️ Watch the walkthrough on YouTube"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bibinprathap/VeritasGraph/blob/restored-main/README.md","fingerprint":"d88a65eaac5e9c8dbb1a74edb8e95cc1abde35a1ed7e468b2f36c4b42fadd4af","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:56:51.276Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:59.006Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Stop chunking blindly. Combine Tree-Search structure with Knowledge-Graph reasoning — and wire it into governed AI agents. Runs 100% locally or in the cloud.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bibinprathap/VeritasGraph/blob/restored-main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> 🏗️ Try the Floorplan-KG demo — free, no login; runs the live PyMuPDF/pdfplumber extraction pipeline.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bibinprathap/VeritasGraph/blob/restored-main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d88a65eaac5e9c8dbb1a74edb8e95cc1abde35a1ed7e468b2f36c4b42fadd4af","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bibinprathap/VeritasGraph/blob/restored-main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:59.007Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T17:50:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bibinprathap/VeritasGraph/blob/restored-main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:59.009Z","hash":"d88a65eaac5e9c8dbb1a74edb8e95cc1abde35a1ed7e468b2f36c4b42fadd4af","originalBytes":36075,"storedBytes":36075,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:58.902Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:12:54.304Z","latestRelease":null,"r